{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/description_logo.png?t=1757152805\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy physics. Chain insane combos. Rack up views. <br>Welcome to the NEXUS! Welcome to.. X-GRAVITY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/c690658262f9eab9eca7b5d066bef0d9.poster.avif?t=1757152805\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/c690658262f9eab9eca7b5d066bef0d9.webm?t=1757152805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/7db12dd49085016d3a360f4dc0073fc8.avif?t=1757152805\" alt=\"Hit Gravity Defying Combos\" width=1600 height=385 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shred impossible lines, chain jaw-dropping combos, and flow across every surface with style on your physics-bending gravboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/93e659c1b5f5a645daf054d80b61a14e.poster.avif?t=1757152805\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/93e659c1b5f5a645daf054d80b61a14e.webm?t=1757152805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/48b855f04e453892dd6f890178bf38f7.avif?t=1757152805\" alt=\"Blaze Through Missions for Cosmic Weirdos\" width=2384 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into the alien metropolis of the NEXUS and take on a fully-fledged career mode, packed with missions like..</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivering &quot;pizza&quot; for <i>Regular Tony</i> - the local mob boss who happens to run a pizza joint (and no, they don\u2019t serve stuffed crust)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping <i>Vexla</i>, the top property mogul, battle a slime infestation threatening her real estate empire - it\u2019s absolute gooey chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tracking down your old mentor, <i>Dr. Philbert</i>, and uncovering his mysterious interdimensional past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and a whole lot more bizarre jobs the NEXUS can throw at you!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/07af1b37c11b7230f982b3e5da77203c.poster.avif?t=1757152805\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/07af1b37c11b7230f982b3e5da77203c.webm?t=1757152805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/02d537c1e9bafc370d8f48fcf77b0d09.avif?t=1757152805\" alt=\"Own Your Style &amp;amp; Rack Up the Views!\" width=2029 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trick your skater out with wild gear, juice up your gravboard to own the streets, and make waves on <i>FlikFlark </i>- the hottest social feed on the NEXUS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/202a00ee91ed0d68a094364efe08c59d.poster.avif?t=1757152805\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/202a00ee91ed0d68a094364efe08c59d.webm?t=1757152805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/bba7ffbb1ac71dbf7f4388a2aeda8b83.avif?t=1757152805\" alt=\"Shred a Psychedelic Alien Metropolis\" width=2037 height=379 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden routes, cosmic secrets, and expose a conspiracy bubbling in the skies of the NEXUS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mentor, <i>Dr. Philbert</i>,<i> </i>has vanished. The black hole that powers the world is glitching hard - and no one\u2019s talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track him down, peel back the layers of a warped reality, and chase down the mysterious shadow council only known as <i>The Board</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivalries, cover-ups, and mind-bending revelations await you in a journey that\u2019s as wild as your ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/a342deb810fd1176a7e1520a51c436bb.poster.avif?t=1757152805\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/a342deb810fd1176a7e1520a51c436bb.webm?t=1757152805\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/11336f71e8952ed1b5959ca768b6141f.avif?t=1757152805\" alt=\"Amp Up. Plug In. Tune Out.\" width=2453 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a line-up of underground artists bringing beats from punk and hip-hop, to electronic and everything in-between. The NEXUS pulses with raw, independent energy - crank it up and shred like the world is watching.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3210100?t=1757152805","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3210100?t=1757152805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/ea03fa240daacca48c8b4c1813331e4a1f330280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757152805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/ea03fa240daacca48c8b4c1813331e4a1f330280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757152805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3210100/extras/description_logo.png?t=1757152805\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy physics. Cha